error[parse]: in a `match`'s header, the braces of `Q { x }` are read as its body: write `Q { x: x }`, or the literal in parentheses, `(Q { x })`
 --> field_shorthand__a_lone_name_in_a_match_header_with_its_body_below.silt:8:11
   |
 8 |   match Q { x }
   |           ^ in a `match`'s header, the braces of `Q { x }` are read as its body: write `Q { x: x }`, or the literal in parentheses, `(Q { x })`
